@baseUrl=http://localhost:8082

### Info
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/info

###

### Send Email - Simple
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/email/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "to": "gtalele@alramz.ae",
    "subject": "Test Email from Spring Boot",
    "from": "notification@alramz.ae",
    "body": "This is a Gaurav test email body."
}

###

### Send Email - With Attachment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/email/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "to": "recipient@example.com",
    "subject": "Test Email with Attachment",
    "from": "sender@example.com",
    "body": "<h1>Hello</h1><p>Please find the attachment.</p>",
    "attachments": [
        {
            "name": "document.pdf",
            "content": "base64-encoded-pdf-data"
        }
    ]
}

###

### Scheduler Management APIs (requires company.scheduler.management-endpoints.enabled=true)

### Get Scheduler Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/secured/scheduler/stat
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Stop Scheduler
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/secured/scheduler/stop
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Restart Scheduler
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/secured/scheduler/restart
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
    "jobGroupName": "notification"
}

### Restart Scheduler for Specific Jobs
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/secured/scheduler/refresh/jobs
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
    "jobGroupName": "notification",
    "jobIds": []
}

### Unregister Jobs
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/secured/scheduler/unregister/jobs
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Hard Stop Scheduler
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/secured/scheduler/hardstop
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
